description: Angular unit and BDD test conventions
globs: src/**/*.spec.ts,tests/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Test Stack

- Jest 28 + `jest-preset-angular` (not Karma/Jasmine for unit tests)
- Setup in `setupJest.ts` — mocks localStorage, sessionStorage, crypto
- jest-cucumber for BDD: `tests/features/*.feature` + `tests/step-definitions/*.steps.ts`

# Style

- Co-located `*.spec.ts` or `unit-tests/` subdirs under features
- Mock services with Jest spies; use `TestBed.configureTestingModule` for component tests
- Do not hit real HTTP or Socket.io in unit tests — mock `httpService`, `socketService`, `GraphqlService`
- Scripts: `npm test`, `npm run test:bdd`, `npm run coverage`
